{% block subject '[GRIIDC] DIF Saved But Not Submitted' %}

{% block body_html %}
Dear {{ recipient.firstName }} {{ recipient.lastName }},<br />
<br />
This email is to notify you that a Dataset Information Form (DIF) has been created.
The DIF {{ dif.dataset.udi }} has been saved, but has not yet been submitted to GRIIDC
for review and approval. Please return to the
<a href="{{ absolute_url(path('pelagos_app_ui_dif_default')) }}?udi={{ dif.dataset.udi }}" class="pagelink" target="_blank">DIF</a>
to submit to GRIIDC.<br>
<br />
Thank you,<br />
<br />
<br />
The GRIIDC Team<br />
{% endblock %}

{% block body_text %}
Dear {{ recipient.firstName }} {{ recipient.lastName }},

This email is to notify you that a Dataset Information Form (DIF) has been created.
The DIF {{ dif.dataset.udi }} has been saved, but has not yet been submitted to GRIIDC
for review and approval.

Please return to the DIF at {{ absolute_url(path('pelagos_app_ui_dif_default')) }}?udi={{ dif.dataset.udi }} to submit to GRIIDC.

Thank you,


The GRIIDC Team
{% endblock %}
